  "description": "Forwards a service's sealed audit entries to the central Audit.API through the Olax.Messaging outbox, in the same transaction as the seals (event \"audit.entries.sealed\"). Also holds the event contract and its hash check, for the consumer. Register with AddOlaxAuditForwarding().",
